    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Top Reasons To Book!<br>🚲 4 Bikes + Golf Cart Included – Cruise to the beach, shops, and dining with ease<br><br>🐾 Pet Friendly (additional $250 fee)<br><br>🍽️ Full Kitchen + Dining Area<br><br>🧺 Washer & Dryer + On-Site Parking<br><br>🏊 Community Pool (seasonally heated)<br><br>📍 Close to Seaside, WaterColor and Rosemary Beach<br><br>✔️ Professionally Managed<br><br>**This property is NOT available to guests under 25. No exceptions.**<br><br>Welcome to Sail and Trails – Your 30A Escape!<br><br>Your perfect 30A getaway starts here in the Greenway Park area of Seagrove Beach! This bright, coastal home offers the space families and friend groups love plus a golf cart for effortless beach days and exploring 30A. Inside, you’ll find open, airy living spaces, comfortable furnishings, streaming TV, and fast Wi-Fi. The fully equipped kitchen and dining area make gathering for meals easy after a day in the sun. Beach days, bike rides, pool afternoons, and sunset dinners, Sail and Trails makes it easy to experience the best of 30A.<br><br>-Sleeping Arrangements (Sleeps 10)-<br><br>Bedroom 1 – Downstairs Primary Suite -Master<br>King Bed + Spacious Ensuite Bathroom <br><br>Bedroom 2 – Upstairs King Bedroom<br><br>Bedroom 3 – Queen Bedroom<br><br>Bedroom 4 – Bunk Room-Two Twin Bunk Beds<br><br>We LOVE Snowbirds! Low Monthly Winter Rates Available.<br>Snowbird Season runs November–February. Monthly rentals require arrival on the 1st and departure on the 1st of a following month. All monthly stays include an additional $150 cleaning fee. Contact us for custom date requests!<br><br>-Nearby Dining and Shopping-<br>Just minutes away, Greenway Station is 30A’s newest hub for food, shopping, and fun. <br><br>Enjoy:<br>Wild Olives Tapas and Wine Bar<br>Pecan Jack’s Ice Cream<br>Local Cantina<br>Canopy Road Café<br>Turbo Coffee<br>Beach boutiques and rentals like YOLO Board <br><br>You’re also just a short ride to Seaside, WaterColor, and Rosemary Beach for even more dining, shopping, and entertainment.<br><br>-Snorkel the Sea Turtle Reef-<br>Explore the Sea Turtle Reef, an artificial reef located offshore near Grayton Beach State Park. Sitting in 12–19 feet of water, it’s a popular spot to see marine life. We recommend bringing a kayak, paddleboard, or flotation device, as Gulf conditions can change quickly.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
